erage.corporateActionGaps). Costs charged on TURNOVER, not flat (0.4% round-trip on churn). Blend = cross-sectional robust-z of β-neutralized earnings yield (value, 60%) + 12-month momentum (40%) — the winner of an 8-hypothesis grid (quant/out/blend_lab.json: IC 0.085 vs 0.063 for the old 4-factor mix; mild selection bias from picking the best of 8, disclosed). Quality/growth still computed & reported (skill.factorIC) but measurably diluted the blend, so they carry zero weight. Accruals (Sloan (NI-OCF)/Assets from screener.in BS+CF annuals, sign-flipped so conservative scores high) is also computed + reported at zero weight until validated — see coverage.accrualsPct. Live weights are REGIME-ADAPTIVE (mom12m cut hard in Risk-off — it crashes in volatile bears); regime.adaptiveVsFixed shows the honest comparison. Backtest longs the top decile ~quarterly vs equal-weight universe. Causal; survivorship-biased; annual fundamentals + 60-day lag; simplified costs. IC = rank corr of score vs 63-day forward return. Not a forecast."}